    {
      "id": "should-use-spatial",
      "name": "ShouldUseSpatial",
      "category": "SweepingMeshSDF",
      "signature": "ShouldUseSpatial(Exact Cells, Cell Size, Avg Edge Len)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Exact Cells",
          "type": "Int"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cell Size",
          "type": "Double"
        },
        {
          "name": "Avg Edge Len",
          "type": "Double"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Encodes heuristic for deciding whether it will be faster to use\n- NarrowBand_SpatialFloodFill\n- Or NarrowBandOnly\nThe heuristic is to use the Spatial method unless you have relatively long edges relative to the width\nof the narrow band.  For a 1-cell wide band, or one where few triangles interact w/ each cell in the band\nthe spatial overhead will probably not be worthwhile.\nTODO: test and tune this ..."
    },
